    "guide": "Log Message Reference",
    "note": "FortiManager and FortiAnalyzer share the same Log Message Reference guide. FortiManager itself only emits the 'event' log type; 'appevent' subtypes below apply to FortiAnalyzer only and are included because they live in the same shared reference.",
